msgid "Malaria Prevention"
msgstr "Malaria Prevention"

msgid ""
"This section provides an overview of key malaria prevention interventions "
"in Malawi. It includes insecticide-treated nets (ITNs) distributed through "
"routine services to EPI and ANC clients, as well as IPTp1 and IPTp3 "
"provided to pregnant women during antenatal care (ANC). The section also "
"presents monthly trends in LLIN distribution and a state-level map showing "
"IPTp3 coverage, helping users understand how malaria prevention "
"interventions are being delivered across the country."
msgstr ""
"This section provides an overview of key malaria prevention interventions "
"in Malawi. It includes insecticide-treated nets (ITNs) distributed through "
"routine services to EPI and ANC clients, as well as IPTp1 and IPTp3 "
"provided to pregnant women during antenatal care (ANC). The section also "
"presents monthly trends in LLIN distribution and a state-level map showing "
"IPTp3 coverage, helping users understand how malaria prevention "
"interventions are being delivered across the country."

